  <name>Coastal Cruise V</name>
  <description>6 high-intensity bursts scattered through a steady endurance base in 120 minutes. Nasal breathing is your guide — if you need your mouth, back off. This strengthens your heart and improves oxygen delivery to muscles. Enjoy the simplicity — no targets to chase, just steady riding.</description>
